      "renderedSHA256": "1f79b8c2e3f4c3d665bd69b89115de0955ae48095ffb31e554fcc054c007210f",
      "opening": "And as his government fell among many, Antigonus obtained Asia, Seleucus Babylon; and of the other n",
      "closing": "the Hellespont, and Cassander possessed Macedonia; as did Ptolemy the son of Lagus seize upon Egypt.",
      "allNarrativeVisible": true,
      "notes": 0,
