      "renderedSHA256": "875b34bf87e2444e5eec9d4b3ba73c9d7733036128ed07858e05a1cd0d8cfdd1",
      "opening": "And while these princes ambitiously strove one against another, every one for his own principality, ",
      "closing": "f Ptolemy the son of Lagus, underwent the reverse of that denomination of Savior, which he then had.",
      "allNarrativeVisible": true,
      "notes": 0,
      "inline": 0,
      "latinSHA256": "d47e726d92c97a22e84bca3b37242c71222be35c000b28dcf3372f1fe0cd78b7",
